# CrossFit Total
tags: benchmark, strength
stimulus: Three lifts, three attempts each; the best attempt of each lift counts, and the three add up.
note: One rep per attempt: back squat, then shoulder press, then deadlift.
score: load, total
Max load, 3 attempts
  1 Back squat
  Rest 2:00
Rest 3:00
Max load, 3 attempts
  1 Shoulder press
  Rest 2:00
Rest 3:00
Max load, 3 attempts
  1 Deadlift
  Rest 2:00
